-----
- SpaceXAI (xAI), Grok Build
- Source: xai-org/grok-build, crates/codegen/xai-grok-markdown/
- Source revision: be713136d2a69080743a3f6b3c72077057e5948f
- License: Apache-2.0 (retained; see source file headers and Cargo.toml)

Purpose
-------
Streaming markdown renderer for terminal UIs: incremental/streaming
rendering with checkpoint-based freezing, syntect syntax highlighting,
terminal color adaptation, LaTeX-to-Unicode math approximation, hyperlink
(OSC 8) extraction, and mermaid/table rendering.

Only mechanical changes were made: package name / prefix
`xai-grok-markdown` -> `theway-markdown`, the dependency on
`xai-grok-markdown-core` -> `theway-markdown-core` (local path), and the
crate shell (Cargo.toml) rewritten for theway's workspace. The
`playground` feature, `[[bin]]` targets, `[[bench]]` target, crossterm,
textarea, and criterion dev-dependencies were not ported; the
`pretty_assertions` dev-dependency was dropped and test imports switched
to std `assert_eq!`. Original copyright headers in the source files are
preserved.

Assets
------
`assets/tokyo-night.tmTheme` is copied from
xai-org/grok-build, crates/codegen/xai-grok-markdown/assets/
(same source revision). `assets/grok-night.tmTheme` is copied from
xai-org/grok-build, crates/codegen/xai-grok-pager-render/assets/
(same source revision).

Upstream lineage
----------------
- ratatui: widget/style/render conventions.
- syntect + two-face: syntax highlighting machinery.
- pulldown-cmark: markdown parsing (shared config in theway-markdown-core).

This crate is not a wholesale redistribution of third-party source.
Dependencies are declared in Cargo.toml; their licenses appear in the
repository root THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES file.
